notes               = "Untitled in source. Rhymed throughout (خاکم / تاکم / پگاهم / هلاکم، then گیاهی / گناهی / سیاهی، then همینم / عاشق‌ترینم). THE LATEST DATE IN THE COLLECTION SO FAR: زمستان ۱۳۸۶ is winter 2007-08, which matters for docs/chronology.md — the book reaches ۱۳۸۶ by page 199, well past the ۱۳۸۰ that file had it reaching at page 202. A poem of self-definition by negation and colour, ending on the same claim as between-explosions (154). Winter is months 10-12 → +622 = 2008. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

من احساس برخورد باران به خاکم
منم شوق مستی که در جان تاکَم
گیاهم که تشنهٔ نسیم پگاهَم.
کویرَم که از عشق باران هلاکم
من آهوی زخمی تو سایهٔ گیاهی
منم ابر شیطان تو فصل گناهی
من از رنگ بی‌رنگی‌ام در ملالم
تو سرخی و سبزی... سپیدی سیاهی.
من اینم که هستم... همینم
در این صف که میبینی عاشق‌ترینم...
زمستان ۱۳۸۶

===machine===

I am the feel of the rain striking my own earth.
I am the longing of the drunkenness in the soul of my vine.
I am the plant that thirsts for the dawn breeze.
I am the desert undone by its love of the rain.
I am your wounded gazelle, you the shade of a plant.
I am the devil's own cloud, you the season of sin.
I am wearied by the colour of my own colourlessness.
You are red and green... white, black.
I am this that I am... just this.
In this row you see before you, I am the one most in love...
Winter 1386

===lantern===

I am the feel of the rain striking my own earth.
I am the longing of the drunkenness in the soul of my vine.
I am the plant that thirsts for the dawn breeze.
I am the desert undone by its love of the rain.
I am your wounded gazelle; you are the shade of a plant.
I am the devil's own cloud; you are the season of sin.
I am wearied by the colour of my own colourlessness.
You are red and green... white, black.
I am this that I am — just this.
In this row you see before you, I am the one most in love...

Winter 1386

